ied as listed"}, {"id": "AO2", "text": "the agreement amended"}, {"id": "AO3", "text": "a reduced form of the two items"}, {"id": "AO4", "text": "the cost recorded and the agreement reviewed at quarter end"}], "available_routes": [{"id": "AR1", "text": "this session"}], "agreement_contents": [{"id": "AC1", "text": "what is supplied"}, {"id": "AC2", "text": "whether the agreement changes"}, {"id": "AC3", "text": "from which cycle"}], "counterpart_role": "The upstream team lead.", "counterpart_position": null, "difference_established": "Three cycles of incomplete handover against a six-item agreement.", "authority_relation": "Peers; the two leads may amend jointly.", "recording_route": "The interface agreement.", "persistence_point": "The next cycle in two weeks.", "exchange_test_point": "B6", "list_note": "Not selectable in available_routes, because only the session itself completes and is evidenced inside the session; a route the participant can only state is an intention: a joint amendment to the interface agreement; to both managers.", "source_note": null, "situation_class_label": "Divided work not arriving from one side", "observation_mode_label": "structured_live_session", "min_seconds": 480, "max_seconds": 900}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D5-S2-010", "stage_code": "S2", "source_version_hash": "3bfa9bf0566abfa4907c0d69a5e9b22428858a242bdf1937ca23d3f428807c7a", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D5-S2-010' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D5-S3-001', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'THE FEATURE TWO FUNCTIONS HAVE PROMISED DIFFERENTLY', 'D5', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.0', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 3, "title": "THE FEATURE TWO FUNCTIONS HAVE PROMISED DIFFERENTLY", "source_digest": "a7893d8f3524f9f220c1052bfd225da2cd4e910c596f5d3897f1d544de0e0bc4", "brief_summary": "The participant reads the brief in the pack and submits the work the submission instructions name.", "participant_pack": [{"document": "D1", "title": "The brief", "text": "You hold the product decision. The customer success lead has escalated a request: three of the largest customers are threatening to leave unless an integration is delivered within six weeks, and she has already told those customers the feature is on the roadmap. The engineering lead states the integration cannot be built in six weeks without pulling engineers off a performance upgrade that is sixty per cent complete and affects all customers. What the record shows: a partial integration could be built in three weeks by one engineer without touching the performance work; the partial option has been discussed with neither the customers nor engineering; your vice-president has asked for a recommendation by Thursday and has said they do not want to referee."}], "submission_instructions": "Produce the position you would put to both leads; what you would ask each; what you would propose and what you would move on; and what would be agreed, recorded and taken forward if it is not. The work is submitted within 3 days.", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D5-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three positions, three enquiries, three shared items, four options; the brief asks for each"}, {"question": "Q-D5-01b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D5-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three positions, three enquiries, three shared items, four options; the brief asks for each"}, {"question": "Q-D5-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D5-03", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three positions, three enquiries, three shared items, four options; the brief asks for each"}, {"question": "Q-D5-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D5-04", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three positions, three enquiries, three shared items, four options; the brief asks for each"}, {"question": "Q-D5-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D5-05", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three positions, three enquiries, three shared items, four options; the brief asks for each"}, {"question": "Q-D5-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D5-06", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "A route the submission names is proposed, not used"}, {"question": "Q-D5-06b", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "The source designates no available_routes item, so the bound question cannot be offered"}, {"question": "Q-D5-07", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three agreement contents and a recording route"}, {"question": "Q-D5-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D5-08", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The brief asks what is taken forward if no agreement holds"}, {"question": "Q-D5-09", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "Stage 3 launch design. no answer row, no MISSING-STATE code"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "SI1", "Item text": "the performance upgrade affects all customers, including the three", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "a performance upgrade that is sixty per cent complete and affects all customers"}, {"Item": "SI2", "Item text": "the Thursday recommendation binds both leads", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "asked for a recommendation by Thursday"}, {"Item": "SI3", "Item text": "the partial option is available to both and discussed with neither", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "the partial option has been discussed with neither the customers nor engineering"}], "source_sheet": {"d5_situation_class": "SC-D5-1", "workplace_demand": "Preparing the position to put to two leads whose commitments on one feature differ, with a recommendation due Thursday.", "relevant_conduct": "The position stated as the participant''s own; whether the other position was asked about; which shared items were named; what was proposed; what change to the participant''s own position was stated; whether an agreement and its recording were stated; what was stated about the difference continuing.", "irrelevant_conduct": "Either lead''s conduct or standing, never recorded or rendered.", "stated_standard": null, "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": null, "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named, and no counterpart is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Accommodations are recorded with the submission; the window may be extended as an accommodation and the extension is recorded.", "unsupported_inferences": "That the customer success lead acted wrongly, which is A D2 matter; that either lead should be told first; anything about diplomacy.", "compatibility_class": "S3-ASYNC-SUBMISSION", "designated_positions": [{"id": "DP1", "text": "the partial integration in three weeks with the performance work untouched"}, {"id": "DP2", "text": "the full integration with the performance work paused"}, {"id": "DP3", "text": "no integration in this cycle and the customers told so"}], "designated_enquiries": [{"id": "DE1", "text": "what the three customers were told in terms"}, {"id": "DE2", "text": "what pausing the performance work would cost and for whom"}, {"id": "DE3", "text": "what the partial integration would and would not deliver"}], "shared_items": [{"id": "SI1", "text": "the performance upgrade affects all customers, including the three"}, {"id": "SI2", "text": "the Thursday recommendation binds both leads"}, {"id": "SI3", "text": "the partial option is available to both and discussed with neither"}], "available_options": [{"id": "AO1", "text": "partial in three weeks"}, {"id": "AO2", "text": "full with the upgrade paused"}, {"id": "AO3", "text": "partial now and full next cycle"}, {"id": "AO4", "text": "both leads take the decision to the vice-president jointly"}], "available_routes": [], "agreement_contents": [{"id": "AC1", "text": "which option"}, {"id": "AC2", "text": "what each lead does"}, {"id": "AC3", "text": "what goes to the vice-president"}], "counterpart_role": "The customer success lead and the engineering lead.", "counterpart_position": "The commitment already made, and the cost of pausing the upgrade.", "difference_established": "The commitment against the engineering position, both in the brief.", "authority_relation": "The vice-president holds the decision and has declined to referee.", "recording_route": "The Thursday recommendation.", "persistence_point": "Thursday, then the six weeks.", "list_note": "Not selectable in available_routes, because a route a submission names is proposed, not used: a joint note to both leads; separate notes to each; a joint meeting before Thursday.", "source_note": "Shared Stage 3 submission with SRC-D2-S3-009, SRC-D4-S3-008; one served instance, a separate observation record in each dimension.", "situation_class_label": "Two parties holding different positions on a decision both must work under", "observation_mode_label": "work_sample", "ai_use": "AI_USE_DECLARATION_REQUIRED", "submission_window_days": 3}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D5-S3-001", "stage_code": "S3", "source_version_hash": "a7893d8f3524f9f220c1052bfd225da2cd4e910c596f5d3897f1d544de0e0bc4", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D5-S3-001' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D5-S3-002', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'THREE STAKEHOLDER GROUPS AND ONE CHANGED DATE', 'D5', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.0', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 3, "title": "THREE STAKEHOLDER GROUPS AND ONE CHANGED DATE", "source_digest": "9ff41dbd0b53a01d505543435758cae4f9d774ea639d4cf9b1672e021d909eee", "brief_summary": "The participant reads the brief in the pack and submits the work the submission instructions name.", "participant_pack": [{"document": "D1", "title": "The brief", "text": "You coordinate a program with three stakeholder groups: the sponsor, the operations teams who will use the new system, and the finance function that holds the budget. Two of five sites move from March to June. What the record shows: the sponsor agreed the change; the operations teams at those two sites have not been told and have already scheduled training; finance has been told and has re-profiled the budget; the reason is a supplier delay confirmed in writing; the revised dates are agreed with the supplier and not with the sites; and the operations lead and the finance lead have each told you the other was consulted first."}], "submission_instructions": "Produce the position you would put; what you would ask each group; what you would propose and what you would move on; and what would be agreed, recorded and taken forward if it is not. The work is submitted within 3 days.", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D5-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three positions, three enquiries, three shared items, four options"}, {"question": "Q-D5-01b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D5-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three positions, three enquiries, three shared items, four options"}, {"question": "Q-D5-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D5-03", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three positions, three enquiries, three shared items, four options"}, {"question": "Q-D5-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D5-04", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three positions, three enquiries, three shared items, four options"}, {"question": "Q-D5-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D5-05", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three positions, three enquiries, three shared items, four options"}, {"question": "Q-D5-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D5-06", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "A route the submission names is proposed, not used"}, {"question": "Q-D5-06b", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "The source designates no available_routes item, so the bound question cannot be offered"}, {"question": "Q-D5-07", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three agreement contents"}, {"question": "Q-D5-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D5-08", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The training dates are the persistence point"}, {"question": "Q-D5-09", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "Stage 3 launch design"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "SI1", "Item text": "the supplier delay, confirmed in writing", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "a supplier delay confirmed in writing"}, {"Item": "SI2", "Item text": "the revised dates, agreed with the supplier", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "the revised dates are agreed with the supplier"}, {"Item": "SI3", "Item text": "the training already scheduled, which affects sites and budget alike", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "have already scheduled training"}], "source_sheet": {"d5_situation_class": "SC-D5-7", "workplace_demand": "Preparing how to work with three stakeholder groups after a date change that one of them has not been told about.", "relevant_conduct": "The position stated as the participant''s own; whether the other position was asked about; which shared items were named; what was proposed; what change to the participant''s own position was stated; whether an agreement and its recording were stated; what was stated about the difference continuing.", "irrelevant_conduct": "The two leads'' accounts, which are the condition of the situation and never the record.", "stated_standard": null, "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": null, "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named, and no counterpart is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Accommodations are recorded with the submission; the window may be extended as an accommodation and the extension is recorded.", "unsupported_inferences": "That either lead misremembered or misled; that any order of telling is correct; anything about stakeholder management.", "compatibility_class": "S3-ASYNC-SUBMISSION", "designated_positions": [{"id": "DP1", "text": "the two sites are told before their scheduled training"}, {"id": "DP2", "text": "all three groups are brought to one date together"}, {"id": "DP3", "text": "the sponsor states the change to all groups"}], "designated_enquiries": [{"id": "DE1", "text": "what training each site has scheduled and when"}, {"id": "DE2", "text": "what the re-profiled budget assumes"}, {"id": "DE3", "text": "what each group understood about consultation order"}], "shared_items": [{"id": "SI1", "text": "the supplier delay, confirmed in writing"}, {"id": "SI2", "text": "the revised dates, agreed with the supplier"}, {"id": "SI3", "text": "the training already scheduled, which affects sites and budget alike"}], "available_options": [{"id": "AO1", "text": "a single joint session for all three groups"}, {"id": "AO2", "text": "the sites told first, then a joint confirmation"}, {"id": "AO3", "text": "the sponsor issues the change and the participant handles the sites"}, {"id": "AO4", "text": "the dates confirmed with the sites before anything else"}], "available_routes": [], "agreement_contents": [{"id": "AC1", "text": "who is told and in what order"}, {"id": "AC2", "text": "what the sites'' training does"}, {"id": "AC3", "text": "what the record says about consultation"}], "counterpart_role": "The operations lead and the finance lead.", "counterpart_position": "Each holds the other to have been consulted first.", "difference_established": "The two accounts of consultation order, in the brief.", "authority_relation": "The sponsor holds the change; the participant coordinates.", "recording_route": "The program record.", "persistence_point": "The scheduled training dates.", "list_note": "Not selectable in available_routes, because a route a submission names is proposed, not used: a joint session; separate written notes; through the sponsor.", "source_note": "counterpart_position: Neither lead''s account is observed and neither may be named in A statement. Shared Stage 3 submission with SRC-D4-S3-002; one served instance, a separate observation record in each dimension.", "situation_class_label": "A difference between two other parties affecting work held", "observation_mode_label": "work_sample", "ai_use": "AI_USE_DECLARATION_REQUIRED", "submission_window_days": 3}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D5-S3-002", "stage_code": "S3", "source_version_hash": "9ff41dbd0b53a01d505543435758cae4f9d774ea639d4cf9b1672e021d909eee", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D5-S3-002' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D5-S3-003', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'FIVE DAYS, TWO FUNCTIONS, ONE CUTOVER', 'D5', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.0', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 3, "title": "FIVE DAYS, TWO FUNCTIONS, ONE CUTOVER", "source_digest": "1eb4764a07b0af2f3f3421f40b970e8778b99c02fbceff9727d467d1fd4aaa2b", "brief_summary": "The participant reads the brief in the pack and submits the work the submission instructions name.", "participant_pack": [{"document": "D1", "title": "The brief", "text": "You are an implementation lead five days from a go-live pulled forward by a client regulatory deadline. The engineering lead reports migration testing at seventy per cent, with the remaining complex module needing about three further days. The account manager reports the client expects a full cutover with no phased fallback. What the record shows: the engagement terms require completed testing before any module goes live; the go-live date is fixed; the three-day estimate is engineering''s and has not been re-checked; and a phased cutover has been used on two previous engagements with this client''s sector."}], "submission_instructions": "Produce the position you would put to both leads; what you would ask each; what you would propose and what you would move on; and what would be agreed, recorded and taken forward if it is not. The work is submitted within 3 days.", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D5-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three positions, three enquiries, three shared items, four options"}, {"question": "Q-D5-01b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D5-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three positions, three enquiries, three shared items, four options"}, {"question": "Q-D5-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D5-03", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three positions, three enquiries, three shared items, four options"}, {"question": "Q-D5-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D5-04", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three positions, three enquiries, three shared items, four options"}, {"question": "Q-D5-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D5-05", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three positions, three enquiries, three shared items, four options"}, {"question": "Q-D5-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D5-06", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "A route the submission names is proposed, not used"}, {"question": "Q-D5-06b", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "The source designates no available_routes item, so the bound question cannot be offered"}, {"question": "Q-D5-07", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three agreement contents"}, {"question": "Q-D5-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D5-08", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The fixed date is the persistence point"}, {"question": "Q-D5-09", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "Stage 3 launch design"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "SI1", "Item text": "the engagement terms bind both functions", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "the engagement terms require completed testing before any module goes live"}, {"Item": "SI2", "Item text": "the fixed regulatory date binds both", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "the go-live date is fixed"}, {"Item": "SI3", "Item text": "the precedent of two phased cutovers in the sector", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "a phased cutover has been used on two previous engagements"}], "source_sheet": {"d5_situation_class": "SC-D5-1", "workplace_demand": "Preparing how to work with two leads whose positions on testing and cutover differ, five days before go-live.", "relevant_conduct": "The position stated as the participant''s own; whether the other position was asked about; which shared items were named; what was proposed; what change to the participant''s own position was stated; whether an agreement and its recording were stated; what was stated about the difference continuing.", "irrelevant_conduct": "What goes live and in what order, which is A D3 matter and not observed here.", "stated_standard": null, "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": null, "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named, and no counterpart is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Accommodations are recorded with the submission; the window may be extended as an accommodation and the extension is recorded.", "unsupported_inferences": "That either function is being obstructive; that phasing is safer; anything about leadership.", "compatibility_class": "S3-ASYNC-SUBMISSION", "designated_positions": [{"id": "DP1", "text": "phased cutover with the tested modules live on the date"}, {"id": "DP2", "text": "full cutover with the complex module untested"}, {"id": "DP3", "text": "go-live held until testing completes"}], "designated_enquiries": [{"id": "DE1", "text": "what the three-day estimate assumes"}, {"id": "DE2", "text": "what the client''s no-fallback expectation rests on"}, {"id": "DE3", "text": "what the two previous phased cutovers involved"}], "shared_items": [{"id": "SI1", "text": "the engagement terms bind both functions"}, {"id": "SI2", "text": "the fixed regulatory date binds both"}, {"id": "SI3", "text": "the precedent of two phased cutovers in the sector"}], "available_options": [{"id": "AO1", "text": "phased cutover"}, {"id": "AO2", "text": "full cutover with a documented exception"}, {"id": "AO3", "text": "testing compressed with a second engineer"}, {"id": "AO4", "text": "the client asked to accept a phased approach"}], "available_routes": [], "agreement_contents": [{"id": "AC1", "text": "what goes live"}, {"id": "AC2", "text": "what the client is told"}, {"id": "AC3", "text": "who tells them"}], "counterpart_role": "The engineering lead and the account manager.", "counterpart_position": "Three more days of testing, and a client expecting full cutover.", "difference_established": "The testing position against the cutover expectation.", "authority_relation": "The participant leads; neither function reports to them.", "recording_route": "The go-live plan.", "persistence_point": "The fixed go-live date.", "list_note": "Not selectable in available_routes, because a route a submission names is proposed, not used: a joint note to both leads; a joint call before the date; through the account manager to the client.", "source_note": "Shared Stage 3 submission with SRC-D3-S3-003, SRC-D4-S3-003; one served instance, a separate observation record in each dimension.", "situation_class_label": "Two parties holding different positions on a decision both must work under", "observation_mode_label": "work_sample", "ai_use": "AI_USE_DECLARATION_REQUIRED", "submission_window_days": 3}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D5-S3-003", "stage_code": "S3", "source_version_hash": "1eb4764a07b0af2f3f3421f40b970e8778b99c02fbceff9727d467d1fd4aaa2b", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D5-S3-003' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
