"the five-business-day clock, already running"}, {"id": "SI3", "text": "the examination next quarter, which matters to both"}], "available_options": [{"id": "AO1", "text": "document and escalate within five days"}, {"id": "AO2", "text": "document now and escalate with a covering note on the examination"}, {"id": "AO3", "text": "a review with the advisor inside the five days, then escalate"}, {"id": "AO4", "text": "the matter referred to the firm''s external counsel"}], "available_routes": [], "agreement_contents": [{"id": "AC1", "text": "what is documented"}, {"id": "AC2", "text": "when it is escalated"}, {"id": "AC3", "text": "what the covering record says"}], "counterpart_role": "The chief compliance officer.", "counterpart_position": "A clean record ahead of the examination is a strategic priority.", "difference_established": "The procedure''s five-day requirement against the stated priority.", "authority_relation": "\"you have no authority to bypass the escalation route.\" Exact brief text.", "recording_route": "The compliance record.", "persistence_point": "The fifth business day.", "list_note": "Not selectable in available_routes, because a route a submission names is proposed, not used: a written flag through the procedure; a conversation with the chief compliance officer first; to external counsel.", "source_note": "counterpart_position: The source establishes no instruction to suppress and no question may recover one. Shared Stage 3 submission with SRC-D4-S3-006; one served instance, a separate observation record in each dimension.", "situation_class_label": "Something needed from a party over whom there is no authority", "observation_mode_label": "work_sample", "ai_use": "AI_USE_DECLARATION_REQUIRED", "submission_window_days": 3}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D5-S3-005", "stage_code": "S3", "source_version_hash": "b698b2fda89220c7a70f39b29d0150a60b42793673d2d636ba0e0d41b336ed7c", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_objec